text.section:
A statement of merger executed by each party to the merger shall contain:

The name of each partnership or limited partnership that is a party to the merger;


The name of the surviving entity into which the other partnerships or limited partnership were merged;


The identification number issued by the Commission to each partnership that has filed a statement of partnership authority that has not been canceled;


The street address of the surviving entity's principal office and of an office in this Commonwealth, if any; and


Whether the surviving entity is a partnership or a limited partnership.
